OL,3,GNEWSAFlights in Scotland, Northern
OL,4,AIreland and northern England disrupted
OL,5,Aby air traffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fand the north of England are being
OL,9,Fdisrupted due to a "technical issue"
OL,10,Fwith air traffic control
OL,12,FNational Air Traffic Services says the
OL,13,Fissue in the Prestwick centre in
OL,14,FAyrshire is "now fixed", and it is
OL,15,Fworking to "safely lift air traffic
OL,16,Fregulations as quickly as we can"
OL,18,FNats says the glitch is not related to
OL,19,Fa software defect that led to the
OL,20,Fcancellation of 2,000 flights across
OL,21,Fthe UK earlier this month
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
